sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Worker A
    participant R as Token allocator + Redis lease
    participant B as Worker B
    participant S as Resource + atomic token check
    A->>R: Acquire lease
    R-->>A: token 1
    Note over A: Long pause (> TTL)
    Note over R: A's lease expires
    B->>R: Acquire lease
    R-->>B: token 2
    B->>S: Write B, token=2
    S-->>B: ACCEPT; last_token=2
    Note over A: Resumes with stale token
    A->>S: Write A, token=1
    S-->>A: REJECT, since 1 < 2
    Note over S: Final state = B
